                "stats-run.json"
              ],
              "whyItMatters": "Without clinical definitions of the exposure and outcome, the findings are uninterpretable and cannot inform any decision.",
              "actionableFix": "Provide a data dictionary or companion variable artifact defining the variables in clinical terms (e.g., what treatment, what outcome).",
              "reentryPoint": "protocol",
              "deterministicVerification": "The manuscript admits variables were not encoded; no variable artifact is included in the review packet.",
              "confidence": 1
